                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="305 2130 305 2142 2066 2144 2070 2124 2064 2095 303 2099 305 2130"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="teeth. I was told several times that some of the shamans even put on a"/>
